Duncan McWilliam, Founder and CEO at Outpost VFX, added: &#x201C;Andy&#x2019;s appointment is part of that. We want to help more stories get told, and we&#x2019;re already engaged in productive discussions with major studios about our approach to emerging creative technology. Our infrastructure has allowed us to adopt new tools responsibly and much faster than the traditional VFX model would allow, and we&#x2019;re well placed to both drive and take advantage of new production methods, with visual effects and filmmaking domain knowledge at the core of our offering.&#x201D;

Outpost VFX is headquartered in the UK, with studios in Stuttgart, Montreal, and Mumbai.

Laura Brand , Russell Brand 's wife, has pledged to obey prison rules after a scandal over her decision to pass on a message from her husband, in which he professed his innocence from behind bars.

In a new video on Russell Brand's YouTube channel, Laura Brand said: &#x201C;Last week&#x2019;s episode drew considerable amount of attention and now that I understand the parameters set by the brilliant and professional staff at HMP Littlehey, I will absolutely honour that.&#x201D;

Laura Brand added that she would continue hosting the couple's Sunday Service show. &#x201C;I am choosing to continue Sunday Service because I really enjoy it,&#x201D; she said. &#x201C;It is also a place where I will continue to be proud to be a wife, a mother and a woman defending her family at a time when the media&#x2019;s image of what kind of a woman I am is under so much scrutiny.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories News BBC Deputy Boss Questions Impact Of "Creative Choices Taken On West Coast Of United States" On UK Audiences News UK Culture Minister Delivers Emotional Plea To YouTube To "Set An Example" & Remove Russell Brand's Channel

